 ONLINE PLATFORMS.'}{'symbol': 'FDX', 'date': '2019-12-18 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Fedex Anticipates Trade Tensions Will Continue To Negatively Impact Co's Results For Remainder Of 2020 - SEC Filing", 'text': "FEDEX SAYS CO ANTICIPATES THAT CONTINUED TRADE TENSIONS WILL CONTINUE TO NEGATIVELY IMPACT CO'S RESULTS FOR REMAINDER OF 2020 - SEC FILING.FEDEX - CO ANTICIPATES THAT SOFTNESS IN EUROPEAN AND ASIA PACIFIC MARKETS WILL ALSO CONTINUE TO NEGATIVELY IMPACT CO'S RESULTS FOR REMAINDER OF 2020.FEDEX - CO ANTICIPATES THAT DECLINES IN INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION WILL ALSO CONTINUE TO NEGATIVELY IMPACT CO'S RESULTS FOR REMAINDER OF 2020."}{'symbol': 'FDX', 'date': '2019-12-18 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Fedex Corp Reports Q2 Earnings Per Share Of $2.13', 'text': '. REPORTS SECOND QUARTER RESULTS.SEES FY 2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE $9.10 TO $10.35.QTRLY EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.13.QTRLY ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $2.51.QTRLY GAAP REVENUE $17.3 BILLION VERSUS $17.8 BILLION.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $2.76, REVENUE VIEW $17.58 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.FEDEX - FISCAL 2020 IS YEAR OF CONTINUED SIGNIFICANT CHALLENGES & CHANGES FOR CO, PARTICULARLY IN QUARTER JUST ENDED DUE TO COMPRESSED SHIPPING SEASON.FORECAST FEDEX GROUND OPERATING MARGINS TO REBOUND TO TEENS IN Q4.FEDEX - LATER TIMING OF THANKSGIVING HOLIDAY RESULTED IN SHIFTING OF CYBER WEEK INTO DECEMBER, WHICH NEGATIVELY IMPACTED QUARTER\'S RESULTS.IN QUARTER, FEDEX EXPRESS RECORDED ASSET IMPAIRMENT CHARGES OF $66 MILLION ($50 MILLION, NET OF TAX, OR $0.19 PER DILUTED SHARE).QTRLY OPERATING RESULTS DECLINED DUE TO WEAK GLOBAL ECONOMIC CONDITIONS, HIGHER FEDEX GROUND COSTS, LOSS OF BUSINESS FROM LARGE CUSTOMER.FEDEX - IN QUARTER, FEDEX EXPRESS RECORDED ASSET IMPAIRMENT CHARGES RELATED TO PERMANENT RETIREMENT OF 10 AIRBUS A310-300 AIRCRAFT & 12 RELATED ENGINES.DURING REMAINDER OF FISCAL 2020, FEDEX EXPRESS WILL MAKE FURTHER NETWORK CAPACITY CHANGES BY REDUCING FLIGHT HOURS."CONTINUES TO EVALUATE IF ADDITIONAL AIRCRAFT RETIREMENTS ARE WARRANTED".FEDEX SEES 2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE $10.25 TO $11.50 BEFORE YEAR-END MTM RETIREMENT PLAN ACCOUNTING ADJUSTMENT, EXCLUDING. TNT EXPRESS EXPENSES, AIRCRAFT IMPAIRMENT CHARGES.'}{'symbol': 'GE', 'date': '2019-12-18 21:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'U.S. FDA Says GE Healthcare Recalls Giraffe Incubators & Omnibeds Due To Potential For Infants To Fall', 'text': "U.S. FDA: :U.S. FDA SAYS GE HEALTHCARE RECALLS GIRAFFE INCUBATORS & OMNIBEDS DUE TO POTENTIAL FOR INFANTS TO FALL.FDA SAYS HAS IDENTIFIED GE HEALTHCARE'S GIRAFFE INCUBATORS & OMNIBEDS RECALL AS A CLASS I RECALL.FDA SAYS 22,961 GIRAFFE INCUBATORS & GIRAFFE OMNIBEDS RECALLED IN THE U.S..FDA SAYS GE HEALTHCARE RECEIVED 6 REPORTS OF INFANT FALLS WITH INJURIES SUCH AS SKULL FRACTURES, HEMATOMA & EDEMA; NO DEATHS WERE REPORTED."}{'symbol': 'GIS', 'date': '2019-12-18 13:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'General Mills Executive Says Company Expects Further Improvement In Organic Sales Growth In Second Half', 'text': "GENERAL MILLS EXEC ON H1 RESULTS - DOUBLE-DIGIT GROWTH IN FREE CASH FLOW ALLOWED US TO REDUCE DEBT BY MORE THAN $600 MILLION THROUGH 6 MONTHS - CONF CALL.GENERAL MILLS EXEC - IN SECOND HALF, WE'LL STEP UP OUR INVESTMENTS IN BRAND-BUILDING AND CAPABILITIES AND FUTURE GROWTH INITIATIVES.GENERAL MILLS EXEC - IN THE SECOND HALF, WE EXPECT TO SEE FURTHER IMPROVEMENT IN OUR ORGANIC SALES GROWTH.GENERAL MILLS EXEC ON YOGURT BUSINESS - WE'LL FACE REDUCED DISTRIBUTION HEADWINDS AS WE MOVE INTO CALENDAR 2020.GENERAL MILLS EXEC - IN H2, WE'LL DRIVE IMPROVEMENT IN U.S. SNACKS AND YOGURT WHILE LAPPING MORE CHALLENGING RETAIL SALES COMPARISONS IN U.S. CEREAL.GENERAL MILLS EXEC ON U.S. FDA REPORT ON GRAIN-FREE DOG FOOD - WE HAVEN'T SEEN IMPACT ON BUSINESSES AS WITNESSED BY STRONG Q2 RESULTS ON BLUE BUFFALO.GENERAL MILLS EXEC - FOR FULL YEAR, WE EXPECT INPUT COST INFLATION AND COGS HMM SAVINGS WILL EACH BE ABOUT 4% OF COST OF GOODS.GENERAL MILLS EXEC ON OPERATING  PROFIT - THERE'S PARTICULAR PRESSURE BECAUSE OF THE UNWINDING OF THE INVENTORY AND THE PET SALES TIMING IN Q3.GENERAL MILLS EXEC ON OPERATING  PROFIT - WILL SEE PRESSURES COME THROUGH PROBABLY MORE ACUTELY IN THIRD QUARTER THAN FOURTH QUARTER."}{'symbol': 'GIS', 'date': '2019-12-18 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'General Mills Reports Fiscal 2020 Second-Quarter Results And Reaffirms Full-Year Guidance', 'text': 'GENERAL MILLS REPORTS FISCAL 2020 SECOND-QUARTER RESULTS AND REAFFIRMS FULL-YEAR GUIDANCE.Q2 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.95.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.88 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.GENERAL MILLS REPORTS FISCAL 2020 SECOND-QUARTER RESULTS AND REAFFIRMS FULL-YEAR GUIDANCE.REAFFIRMS FULL-YEAR FISCAL 2020 GUIDANCE FOR SALES, PROFIT, AND EPS AND RAISES GUIDANCE FOR FREE CASH FLOW CONVERSION.QTRLY NET SALES OF $4.4 BILLION WERE FLAT TO LAST YEAR.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $3.36, REVENUE VIEW $17.22 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.NOW EXPECTS 2020 FREE CASH FLOW CONVERSION OF AT LEAST 105% OF ADJUSTED AFTER-TAX EARNINGS.Q2 NET SALES FOR THE PET SEGMENT INCREASED 16 PERCENT TO $389 MILLION.SECOND-QUARTER NET SALES FOR GENERAL MILLS\' NORTH AMERICA RETAIL SEGMENT TOTALED $2.68 BILLION, ESSENTIALLY MATCHING YEAR-AGO LEVELS.SECOND-QUARTER NET SALES FOR CONVENIENCE STORES & FOODSERVICE SEGMENT WERE IN LINE WITH LAST YEAR AT $514 MILLION.GENERAL MILLS CEO SAYS "WILL BUILD ON OUR TOPLINE MOMENTUM IN SECOND HALF, FUELED BY INCREASED INVESTMENT IN OUR BRANDS".Q2 REVENUE VIEW $4.43 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2019-12-18 15:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'IBM Research Partners With Mercedes-Benz Research & Development North America', 'text': 'IBM - IBM RESEARCH HAS JOINED WITH MERCEDES-BENZ RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT NORTH AMERICA TO CREATE NEXT-GENERATION BATTERY DEVELOPMENT ECOSYSTEM.'}{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2019-12-18 16:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Shandong Fontacea Announces License Agreement With Janssen', 'text': "SHANDONG FONTACEA ANNOUNCES LICENSE AGREEMENT WITH JANSSEN TO DEVELOP AND COMMERCIALIZE ANTI-IL17A MONOCLONAL ANTIBODY.SHANDONG FONTACEA SAYS LICENSES JANSSEN'S ANTI-IL17A MONOCLONAL ANTIBODY PROGRAM."}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2019-12-18 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Leidos Holdings Expects Deal With Dynetics To Add About $1 bln Of Annualized Revenue In 2020 - Presentation', 'text': 'LEIDOS HOLDINGS INC - EXPECTS THE DEAL WITH DYNETICS TO ADD ABOUT $1 BILLION OF ANNUALIZED REVENUE IN 2020 - PRESENTATION.LEIDOS HOLDINGS INC - EXPECT TO ADD OVER $110 MILLION OF ANNUALIZED ADJUSTED EBITDA IN 2020 FROM DEAL WITH DYNETICS - PRESENTATION.LEIDOS HOLDINGS INC - SEES $40 MILLION ONE-TIME PRE-TAX EXPENSE; ABOUT $32 MILLION AFTER TAX, FROM DEAL WITH DYNETICS - PRESENTATION.'}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2019-12-18 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Leidos To Acquire Dynetics, Strengthening Its Innovation And Leadership Position In Defense, Intelligence, And Civil Markets', 'text': 'LEIDOS TO ACQUIRE DYNETICS, STRENGTHENING ITS INNOVATION AND LEADERSHIP POSITION IN DEFENSE, INTELLIGENCE, AND CIVIL MARKETS.LEIDOS HOLDINGS INC - DEAL FOR $1.65 BILLION.LEIDOS HOLDINGS - DEAL EXPECTED TO BE IMMEDIATELY ACCRETIVE TO REVENUE GROWTH, EBITDA MARGINS, AND NON-GAAP DILUTED EPS.LEIDOS HOLDINGS INC -  EXPECTS TO FUND $1.65 BILLION CASH TRANSACTION THROUGH A COMBINATION OF CASH ON HAND AND INCREMENTAL DEBT.LEIDOS HOLDINGS INC -  ONCE TRANSACTION IS COMPLETED, DYNETICS WILL OPERATE AS A WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF LEIDOS.'}{'symbol': 'MCK', 'date': '2019-12-18 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Mckesson Reaffirms FY 2020 Adjusted Earnings Per Share View $14.00 To $14.60', 'text': 'MCKESSON REAFFIRMS FISCAL 2020 GUIDANCE.REAFFIRMS FY 2020 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $14.00 TO $14.60.MCKESSON - REAFFIRMED ITS ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER DILUTED SHARE GUIDANCE OF $14.00 TO $14.60 FOR FISCAL YEAR ENDING MARCH 31, 2020.'}{'symbol': 'PAYX', 'date': '2019-12-18 12:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Paychex Reports Q2 Adjusted Earnings Per Share $0.70', 'text': 'PAYCHEX, INC. REPORTS SECOND QUARTER RESULTS.Q2 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.70.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.72.Q2 REVENUE $990.7 MILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $987.7 MILLION.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.68 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.SEES FISCAL 2020 MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS REVENUE TO GROW IN RANGE OF 5% TO 5.5%.SEES FISCAL 2020 DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE TO GROW IN RANGE OF 9% TO 10%.SEES 2020 PEO AND INSURANCE SERVICES REVENUE ANTICIPATED TO GROW IN RANGE OF 25% TO 30%.'}{'symbol': 'PRU', 'date': '2019-12-18 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Prudential Financial Says Implementation Costs For Programs Announced During Investor Day In June 2019 Are Expected To Be About $360 Million In Q4 Of 2019', 'text': 'PRUDENTIAL FINANCIAL - IMPLEMENTATION COSTS FOR PROGRAMS ANNOUNCED DURING INVESTOR DAY IN JUNE 2019 ARE EXPECTED TO BE ABOUT $360 MILLION IN Q4 OF 2019.PRUDENTIAL FINANCIAL SAYS EXPECTS TOTAL IMPLEMENTATION COSTS FOR PROGRAMS ANNOUNCED DURING INVESTOR DAY IN JUNE 2019 TO BE ABOUT $400 MILLION FOR 2019.PRUDENTIAL FINANCIAL SEES CUMULATIVE RUN-RATE MARGIN IMPROVEMENT RELATED TO PROGRAMS OF ABOUT $50 MILLION BY END OF 2019 - SEC FILING.PRUDENTIAL FINANCIAL - SEES TOTAL IMPLEMENTATION COSTS FOR PROGRAMS ANNOUNCED DURING ITS INVESTOR DAY IN JUNE 2019 OF ABOUT $175 MILLION IN 2020.PRUDENTIAL FINANCIAL INC SEES CUMULATIVE RUN-RATE MARGIN IMPROVEMENT RELATED TO PROGRAMS BETWEEN ABOUT $250 MILLION AND $300 MILLION BY END OF 2020.PRUDENTIAL FINANCIAL INC SEES CUMULATIVE RUN-RATE MARGIN IMPROVEMENT RELATED TO PROGRAMS TO BE $500 MILLION BY END OF 2022.PRUDENTIAL FINANCIAL - SEES CUMULATIVE RUN-RATE MARGIN IMPROVEMENT RELATED TO PROGRAMS BETWEEN ABOUT $400 MILLION & $450 MILLION BY END OF 2021.PRUDENTIAL FINANCIAL - SEES TOTAL IMPLEMENTATION COSTS FOR PROGRAMS DURING INVESTOR DAY IN JUNE 2019 OF ABOUT $75 MILLION IN 2021 & ABOUT $50 MILLION IN 2022.'}{'symbol': 'QRVO', 'date': '2019-12-18 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Qorvo Announces Pricing Of Offering Of Additional $200 Million Of 4.375% Senior Notes Due 2029', 'text': 'QORVO AN